{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"contract","type":"text","text":"## 状态与资源归属\nSlot／BossState持久保存ASC；AbilitySet持有本次授予句柄。\nInput持有物理来源，Hero持有有限意图，ASC持有原请求、held/queued及准入。\nGA持有原激活、终止记录和招式资源；ASC认证Try／Ended见证及发布原Notice，GAS负责执行。\nTask持有原Playback／Guard、订阅、scale和Ticket；Animation声明并执行姿态，CMC唯一执行胶囊XYZ。\nCombat的Owned Window负责查询和命中去重；GA／GE／Execution／AttributeSet承担伤害结算。\n同Binding Refresh保留精确原End资格；旧输入／镜头／移动／播放权限仍依其原来源校验。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|终止接口]]","x":0,"y":1570,"width":1450,"height":390,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k4notice","type":"text","text":"## FGGYGOAvatarBindingNoticeEvent\nASC持有原生多播的私有封装；仅ASC可Broadcast，外部不能复制或转成可广播基类。\nASC::OnAvatarBindingNotice() → 借用订阅入口。\nAddUObject／AddWeakLambda等 → 原调用方的监听句柄。\nRemove(Handle)／RemoveAll(Object) → 撤自己的监听。\n参数：const Receipt& 与 const Notice&，原历史载荷不当当前权限。\n接收者通过IsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching并核对自身原资源。\n实际消费者：[[Combatants/结构|Host]]原Dispatching桥接[[Character/结构|Extension]]真实Ready；Health/Base/Hero消费自己的原H。","x":840,"y":2700,"width":680,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"k4exec","type":"text","text":"## 同一UGGYGOASC｜ActorInfo事务与一次发布\nGetAvatarBindingContext / CheckAvatarBindingContext → 唯一身份读取／核对。\nTryExecuteAvatarActorInfoTransaction → 精确Current正常准入。\nTryBootstrapAvatarActorInfoTransaction → Unissued且完整空Context。\nTryReplaceRevokedAvatarActorInfoTransaction → 精确Revoked显式替换；三者不互为错误兜底。\nIsAvatarBindingNativeWriteBusy → 包住完整Super、返回重检及Commit；窗口内Busy，不排队。\nInvalidateAvatarBinding → 撤工作/匹配发布许可，保留原提交快照仅作cleanup；真实ActorInfo写前退休。\nPublishAvatarBindingNotice(Receipt, Query) → 校验原Proof／Context／实际字段及必需同步纯谓词，一次事件与逐项GA通知。\nIsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching(Receipt) → 仅精确真实Dispatching；Pending／历史不通过。\nIsAvatarBindingPublicationContextCurrent(Context) → 仅当前Dispatching／成功Consumed，不是全局Ready。\nASC独占一个发布记录与阶段；失败Closed、成功Consumed分开，无第二Avatar／Issuer／历史队列。\n发布不占原生Busy；合法B接续后，A历史bCommitted保留、返回Stale，只清A。\n旧Init／Clear／项目Refresh仍独占原生窗口；基类非虚Refresh绕行不在保障内。","x":-560,"y":2080,"width":730,"height":560,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-failed-init-cleanup-proof","type":"text","text":"## 同一ASC｜未commit Init原写入证明\n私有const FFailedAvatarActorInfoInitCleanupProof持OriginalOperation、Before、完整WrittenActual；原allocation防复用，Actor弱引用，不存caller闭包。\n普通/Bootstrap/Replace的native Init完整返回后捕获；未commit失败且原场景仍匹配才保留，成功commit不保留。\nTryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation, pureOriginalCallerQuery) → 核成员原Proof/Before/allocation/全字段，query在既有Busy内前后重检。\n先消费Proof再唯一qualified Super::ClearActorInfo；核真实清空后置条件，raw AnimInstance/Tag按GAS保留。\nSucceeded只为物理cleanup，bCommitted=false、Context空，无Receipt/Notice/Ready；原Init仍失败，native后失败不重发Proof。\n后继真实typed/legacy写、消费或ASC销毁释放；无第二绑定/序号/队列/执行器。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#失败Init原写入清理（未提交证明）|来源/消费/后置条件]]","x":-730,"y":4258,"width":730,"height":395,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-cleanup-host-consumer","type":"text","text":"## Host清理接口\n[[Combatants/结构|CombatantState]]持有选择、原H和请求scope；ASC持有ActorInfo写入与来源证明，[[Character/结构|Extension]]持有本地通知资源。\n已提交来源：CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext认证原Context；调用方显式选择ClearMode。\n未提交Init来源：TryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit消费原Operation与pure scope；清理不把原Init改为成功。\n清理scope与初始化scope分别负责自身资源，不从后继Context续权。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#清理调用方|调用方接口]]","x":840,"y":4258,"width":680,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"k4cancel","type":"text","text":"## 同一ASC｜原归属限定清理\nTryCancelAvatarBindingAbilities(Expected, With, Without, pureQuery)：原Context／业务筛选／原清理资源；null With不筛选，非null空With匹配零，标签栈复制。\nTryRemoveAvatarBindingGameplayCues(Expected, pureQuery)：原清理作用域，不依赖Ready或已撤本地缓存；一次原生Active Tag清理，不承诺全Cue结束。\n二者复用I1/native Busy与MatchCommittedCleanupContext：Query前后/完整返回核原Current或Revoked提交来源，关匹配发布许可后一次Super/Complete；不改Binding/ActorInfo，无Commit/Receipt/Notice。\n失效只退原Operation，不清后继／回滚已发生动作，无第二执行器。","x":-560,"y":3480,"width":730,"height":290,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4-committed-cleanup-source","type":"text","text":"## 同一ASC｜已提交cleanup来源\nCheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(Expected, OutReason) const → 纯GT认证原Issuer/Context/LastWrite、ActorInfo allocation与完整快照；Current或Revoked，不执行/签发/Ready。\n单个AvatarBindingActorInfoSnapshot：逻辑撤销保留cleanup；真实typed/legacy写前退休，同端点也不续权。\nWorkingBinding仍Current/live；CommittedCleanup允许仍合法分配且Destroy中的原Owner/Avatar，无效ASC/字段变化明确失败。\nCancel/Cue/Clear消费同一来源/原native窗口；关闭Owner或宿主PreserveOwner→LifecycleClosed，调用方显式ClearActorInfo，不失败后换模式。\nTyped Clear沿既有提交/Released契约；query本身不发布。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原已提交清理来源（Destroy）|来源/失效/模式]]","x":840,"y":3405,"width":680,"height":365,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k4receipt","type":"text","text":"## FGGYGOAvatarBindingPublicationReceipt\nTryGetCommittedEvidence(Result, Notice) → 先清输出，只复制历史；true不等于当前绑定／发布／Ready。\nASC唯一创建私有const Proof；保存原Kind、Before弱端点、Result／Notice，复制共享历史资源。\nInit／Refresh描述After；Clear为Released并保留Before，owner-only Init不等同Clear。\nPublish须另核对当前原Proof；历史副本仍可读取，却不能清后继或执行新动作。","x":880,"y":2220,"width":680,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"input","type":"text","text":"## Input／Hero\nInput持有原生Key/Device来源，Hero持有Action观察、有限缓冲和自身订阅，ASC唯一持有Spec的held/queued聚合。\nHero调用ReceiveAbilityInputRequest／EndAbilityInputRequest／QueueAbilityInputRetry，传原ID、Tag和截止时间。\nHero订阅Extension的typed本地H；移动来源会话由Source提供，CMC负责执行。\nPlayerController::PostProcessInput是ProcessAbilityInput的唯一帧入口。\n[[Input/结构|Input接口]]","x":-1260,"y":65,"width":580,"height":290,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"host","type":"text","text":"## 持久状态宿主\nSlot／BossState持有ASC，Host持有Avatar选择、原H和请求scope；ActorInfo写入归ASC。\nRequestAvatarBinding消费ASC事务及发布接口；Extension持有本地H。\nHost使用原提交Context或未提交Init的原Operation分别认证自身清理，并显式传ClearMode。\nHealth／Base／Hero持有各自的H订阅与资源。\n[[Combatants/结构|Host接口]]","x":-1440,"y":630,"width":760,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# AbilitySystem｜结构图\nASC持有输入请求、组准入、ActorInfo事务及原资源认证；GA持有原激活、终止记录和招式资源；Task持有自身播放与订阅。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|执行流程]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_原请求终止|终止契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|终止流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害流程]] · [[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|命中反馈]]","x":-800,"y":-880,"width":1520,"height":205,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"asc","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nReceive／End／Queue管理原输入ID、Spec held/queued和有序边沿。\nNotifyAbilityFailed（final）消费独立Can来源；OnAbilityInputRetryable发布完整原Retry。\nIsActivationBlockedByGroup提供只读准入查询；FinalizeAbilityGroupAdmission执行组终检，ActiveAbilitiesByGroup是项目组登记。\nTryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary返回原Try结果与退出见证；OnAbilityTerminationCompleted发布GA原记录的完成事实。\nCheckOriginalAbilityBindingForTermination认证同Binding的原allocation／ASC／Owner／Avatar，不续签旧资源工作权限。\nClientCorrectAbilityState按Spec／实例／key路由；ActorInfo事务及发布接口见下方。","x":-320,"y":-50,"width":490,"height":570,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"set","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOAbilitySet\n`GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)` → 按 AttributeSet、GA、GE 顺序授予。\n`GrantedHandles::TakeFromAbilitySystem(ASC)` → 收回这次授予。","x":-320,"y":850,"width":490,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"effect","type":"text","text":"## 伤害 / 表现接口\nDamageExecution::Execute → Origin到HitPoint距离衰减，写目标元属性。\nEffectContext::Duplicate → 保留显式Origin。\nHitImpact::HandleGameplayCue / OnExecute → K2 / Super前Resolve原输入；默认HitResult必需，不自动换Target。BP可显式选参数位置/目标中心。\n已知表面漏配默认拒绝；原点/Overlap合法。\nGameplayCueManager → 加载/分发；接口/配置/生命周期见[[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构|子模块]]与[[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|结构子图]]。","x":-245,"y":1150,"width":490,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"attr","type":"text","text":"## HealthSet / CombatSet\nHealthSet持有生命／韧性及Damage／Healing／PoiseDamage元属性、边界与结果委托。\n有限Health／Poise Base是内部量；Current限制在0～Max。\nCombatSet提供BaseDamage／BaseHeal／BasePoiseDamage捕获输入。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|Current结算接口]]","x":660,"y":1210,"width":660,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"config","type":"text","text":"## 仲裁配置\n`UGGYGOAbilityGroupConfig`：GroupTag → 共存/独占/排队规则。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`：能力 Tag → 额外要求/阻断/取消 Tag。\n两者由 PawnData 注入 ASC。","x":840,"y":-108,"width":400,"height":225,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"attribute-current-base-calculation","type":"text","text":"## 同一ASC｜Current → Base计算\nTryCalculateNumericAttributeBaseForCurrentValue(ExpectedAttributeSet, Attribute, ExpectedCurrent, DesiredCurrent)\n输入：原Set、注册的FGameplayAttributeData属性、实际Current和目标Current；游戏线程／权威端。\n输出：FGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationResult；不写属性，不决定业务边界。\nGAS原生capture／默认及自定义资格／通道求值提供本次计算输入；快照和原生临时通道仅栈内存活。\n原Set／ASC／Owner／Base／Current与聚合来源须保持匹配；不要求持久属性的Avatar Ready。\nASC不维护第二聚合公式、业务缓存或结算状态。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Current 与 Base 数值接口|输入、输出与职责]]","x":1760,"y":1210,"width":660,"height":600,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"attribute-base-calculation-result","type":"text","text":"## FGGYGOAttributeBaseCalculationResult\nOutcome／Reason／CalculatedBase是本次计算返回值，不持有属性或聚合器。\nReady＋None：只有有限Base候选；实际写入与OwnPost确认归HealthSet。\nRejected：无效依赖、不可逆通道、非法Divisor、非有限值或正向不匹配。\nStale：SourceChanged／AggregationChanged；原来源或聚合已经变化。\n失败值不作候选，不授权补偿、旁写Current或保存后重试。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的 Current 结算|HealthSet消费者]]","x":1760,"y":2040,"width":660,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k3-task-resource-consumer","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent\n持有原Ability／ActorInfo／ASC／Mesh／Anim来源与Montage唯一Slot，消费ASC单一Playback／Guard。\nRegisterNativeCallbacks在Ready前接受一次非空回调包，返回精确token；包含五普通回调、SectionReceived、NotifyReceived和OnFailed。\nTryGetOriginalSectionSnapshot输出原ID／Section／Position／Rate；作者点接口见下方。\nGA拥有原Activation、段资源及打断许可；Task事实不授工作权。\nAcquireActionPoseContract返回ExplicitNotRequired或RequiredReady及原Ticket；Required模式使用引擎TickTask只读Poll。\nOnFailed携Montage／Slot／Stage／Diagnostic和原InstanceID，是自身清理后的失败事实。\nTask管理自身监听、实例委托、缩放和Ticket；按原Guard／ID释放资源，不从当前Avatar认领后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费|接口与资源]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态接口]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA资源]]","x":3780,"y":540,"width":900,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k3-playback-asc","type":"text","text":"## 同一ASC｜精确原Local播放来源\nTryPlayMontageWithOwnership(GA,Activation,Montage,Rate,Section,Time,pureQuery)：完整Super／Guard后认证源与Local一致，返回单一Result，成功才签Playback。\nCheckMontagePlaybackOwnership(Original)：纯原资源校验，停止／无活动实例不丢清理资格。\nCaptureMontagePlaybackOwnership(原GA,Spec,Activation)：只取已有认证记录；缺失NoOwnedPlayback，不造新Handle。\nTryClearMontageAnimatingAbility(Original)：精确Check后仅基类GA setter／Local清空，退休原记录；不Stop／延迟混出。\n唯一provenance持原ActorInfo快照，不是播放状态／第二执行器。\n实际Init／Clear退休；同端点Refresh无真实变化则保留。原生可截获入口核对，拒绝外层不清后继。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属|完整契约]]","x":2600,"y":-313,"width":820,"height":318,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k3-playback-values","type":"text","text":"## 原Handle／结果与Animation接缝\nFGGYGOAbilityMontagePlaybackHandle：私有const Proof，仅ASC签发；HasPlayback／HasSamePlayback只读身份。\nProof含原ASC、GA／Spec／ActivationKey、Montage、Guard完整证据与Local计数一致性；8位计数不是唯一身份。\nResult／Check／Clear：Outcome＋Reason＋Guard历史＋原Handle；Failed不补成功资源。\nAnimation Guard唯一提供生命周期／非复用CallId／CreatedInstanceId，ASC认证真实Local写入；Task只持原资源。\n限定基类写入绕行不属于项目接口认证范围；资源值不持有网络协议或帧调度。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_AbilitySystem#当前精确Montage增量（K3）|设计说明]]","x":2530,"y":-860,"width":960,"height":235,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ga","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\nCan／Activate／End／Cancel为final；CanActivateAbilityAdditional只追加业务准入条件。\nCaptureCurrentActivation按ResourceWork校验原完整Context／LastWrite／来源，返回不可变Original。\nInitializeAbilityActivation负责原批次初始化；ActivateAbilityBody承接派生招式业务。\nRequestAbilityEnd／Cancel消费精确Original；GA唯一持有首次TerminationContext、原资源及返回义务。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination归还原批次资源；GAS持有实际Active／Spec／Task及原生终止执行。\nBuildHitEffectPayload返回Context／Spec／Cue输入；必需Spec无效明确失败，响应由具体GA负责。\n[[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|原激活与终止流程]]","x":770,"y":600,"width":440,"height":520,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ability-input-original-resource-values","type":"text","text":"## 原输入接口／普通值\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRequestIdentity：原weak ASC＋InputRevision＋非零RequestSerial；rev0合法，弱身份保持index/serial。\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRetryRequest：InputTag＋Identity＋原World有限绝对OriginalDeadline；默认-1无效。\nReceiveAbilityInputRequest(Tag,PreviousID,Deadline)：空ID签原请求；非空仅复核原资源，冻结首次Spec集合／Owner/Avatar/World。\nEndAbilityInputRequest(ID,Kind)：Released最后来源发释放且保留有限tap；Invalidated退休不伪Released，原义务不借当前Ready。\nQueueAbilityInputRetry(const OriginalRetry&)：完整ID/Tag/deadline＋真实Queued许可，不延长窗口或替held。\nOnAbilityInputRetryable(const OriginalRetry&)：本次Can精确来源，不按Tag找最近请求。\nResult只为Accepted/AlreadyApplied/Rejected/Stale历史，不代表技能激活；这些值不持第二held权威。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源（B0）|接口契约]]","x":1520,"y":-80,"width":660,"height":460,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"w0-original-input-subscription","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOAbilityTask_WaitComboInput\nWaitComboInput(OwningAbility)返回未Ready Task；SetSourceStep提供来源段，OnPress输出SourceStep／RequestId。\nRegisterNativeCallback在Ready前接受一次非空FGGYGOComboInputNativeDelegate，返回FDelegateHandle；UnregisterNativeCallback只匹配原token。\nTask持有原弱ASC／Ability、Spec／PredictionKey、remote/predict模式及自身订阅；零key合法，桶身份不是GA激活身份。\nInputPressed来源于GAS原事件桶；本地预测使用原ASC预测窗口，远端整数载荷须通过范围校验。\nOnDestroy归还原桶中的自身handle与native注册包；GA负责Original、段序和原批次资源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原事件桶与输入Task订阅（W0）|接口与清理]]","x":2500,"y":640,"width":900,"height":325,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"montage-native-notify-interface","type":"text","text":"## 同一Montage Task｜作者点接口\nResolveOriginalMontageNotify(Montage,Name,OutTime,Diagnostic)：恰一stock native点；原LinkedMontage／branchingpoint及有限TriggerTime，缺／重／错类型拒绝。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify(Name,Diagnostic)：原AwaitingActivation、Ready前一次配置。\nTryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot(Fact,Position)：固定ID原实例与同一作者声明的只读快照；false清输出，不合成通知。\nFNativeCallbacks.NotifyReceived／BP NotifyReceived：精确原点事实，自然blend原实例可送达，退休Task不能接旧点。\n持有原Notify UObject／名字／时间和原AnimInstance订阅；不存数组裸指针或Editor GUID，不持业务门／输入／CMC或第二时钟。\nOnDestroy只RemoveDynamic原对象／本Task／NotifyBegin函数。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|接口与来源]]","x":3840,"y":1320,"width":900,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"montage-native-notify-fact","type":"text","text":"## FGGYGOMontageNotifyFact\nMontage／Mesh／int32 MontageInstanceId／NotifyName／NotifyPositionSeconds。\n时间为作者GetTriggerTime含offset，非后来回调位置；快照另给原实例实际Position。\n来源封套为原Task／Guard／ActorInfo与配置原点，不借float Magnitude或ASC CancelPoint认证。\n事实不授当前播放、原GA／输入／镜头／CMC工作权。\nGA核原Activation／StepToken／Task／资源后消费，原资源持本播放许可。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA消费者]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|数据契约]]","x":3840,"y":1940,"width":900,"height":290,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"input","fromSide":"right","toNode":"asc","toSide":"left","label":"提交输入或语义激活请求"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"host","fromSide":"right","toNode":"asc","toSide":"left","label":"Owner 持有 ASC；Avatar 可更换"},
